  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to AWEN 2019-2022 - Protection and Promotion of women rights in Albania</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Women rights and organising</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen syftar till att skydda och fr&#xe4;mja kvinnors r&#xe4;ttigheter i Albanien och genomf&#xf6;rs av AWEN. Programmet omfattar en 4-&#xe5;rsperiod. Interventionen fokuserar p&#xe5; tre komponenter: 1) F&#xf6;respr&#xe5;kande och lobbyverksamhet p&#xe5; nationell och internationell niv&#xe5; f&#xf6;r att skydda och fr&#xe4;mja kvinnors r&#xe4;ttigheter; 2) Institutionell utveckling och organisationsf&#xf6;rst&#xe4;rkning av AWEN och dess medlemmar; 3) St&#xf6;d till AWEN-medlemmar f&#xf6;r att erbjuda specialiserade st&#xf6;dtj&#xe4;nster, p&#xe5;verkans&#xe5;tg&#xe4;rder, medvetenhets- och kapacitetsbyggande relaterade &#xe5;tg&#xe4;rder f&#xf6;r att st&#xe4;rka kvinnors r&#xe4;ttigheter p&#xe5; lokal niv&#xe5;.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention aims at protecting and promoting women rights in Albania and is implemented by AWEN. The programme covers a 4 year period. The intervention focuses on three components: 1) Advocacy and lobbing at national and international level to protect and promote women rights; 2) Institutional Development and organisations strengthening of AWEN and its members; 3) Support to AWEN members to offer specialised support services, advocacy actions, awareness and capacity building related action to enhance women rights at the local level.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the programme is:&#xa0;Increased role and contribution of women civil society organizations for the protection, promotion and respect of women human rights in Albania.
The specific objectives of the programme are the following:
1. Improved and implemented policies and legal framework for protection and promotion of women human rights.2. Strengthening of institutional/ organizational capacities of AWEN and its members in becoming more democratic, accountable, independent, sustainable and capable to promote and protect women human rights.3. Protection and empowerment of vulnerable groups of girls and women, with a special focus on gender based violence and trafficking survivors.</narrative>
  </description>
